{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2022-05-23 17:24:00', 'title': 'RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ST. PETERSBURG, FLA., MAY 23, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ON MAY 23, 2022, THE RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: RJF) BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.34 PER SHARE, PAYABLE JULY 15, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JULY 1, 2022.'}